          "content": "kit-version-source: 0.3.0 · brief-schema: 1\nVendored from _playground.pen at 0.3.0; the flows are at 0.4.0. Not re-vendored: these screens only use Button, Emblem and tokens, and the 0.4.0 changes (disabled Button, focus token) do not show here. Desktop only: a desk tool.\n1. PURPOSE\nA hidden workshop to evaluate Knotty's own furniture before users do: open any module variant in the real Studio, change anything, see what Knotty computes (errors, geometry warnings, findings) and swap the expert's model, without touching the saved design.\n2. ENTRY POINTS\nThe debug access (Konami code, Ctrl+Shift+D, the settings switch, ?debug) shows a «Taller» button beside «Bitácora» and «Banco» (NEW, src/ui/debug/DebugPanel.tsx). «Salir del taller» returns to the saved design.\n3. SCREENS (top → bottom, one column)\nOpen: bench drawer on the left, Studio scene in the middle, panel on the right on «Hallazgos».\nBanco collapsed: a rail with the verdict count.\nBoth collapsed: the scene alone.\nNo variant open: where the lab starts.\nModel switcher: the expert chip opened.\n4. BUSINESS RULES\nWhile the lab is on, designs live in memory and the saved one is never read or written (src/adapters/persistence/sandbox.ts, enterLab and leaveLab in src/ui/store/session.ts).\nThe middle and the panel are the real Studio (src/ui/studio/Studio.tsx, src/ui/scene/Scene.tsx). Variants come from module.benchVariants() and their verdict from analyze() (src/application/bench/bench.ts, runModules).\nThe model is read on every call (expert() in src/composition.ts), so a change applies to the next one.\n«Nuevo diseño» closes the open variant and stays in the lab (newDesign in session.ts).\n5. COPY SOURCE\nExisting: src/ui/debug/BenchPanel.tsx (Banco de pruebas, Sin experto…, Con el experto, Revisar, Correr, Todos), src/ui/studio/Studio.tsx (tabs, views, Nuevo diseño), src/ports/Preferences.ts (provider descriptions, expert label), src/domain/design/validation/geometry.ts (the warning).\nNEW: Taller · Salir del taller · Hallazgos · Errores · Avisos de geometría · Hallazgos estructurales · Ninguno · Seleccionar las piezas · Copiar · Taller: nada de esto se guarda · Nada de lo que hagas aquí se guarda · Elige una variante del banco · Se abre aquí… · Abre una variante del banco… · Lo que Knotty calcula de… · El cambio vale desde la siguiente llamada.\nExample data, not measured: 47 / 41 variants, the counts, the piece pair in the warnings.\n6. STATES NOT DRAWN\nMobile (a desk tool). The Conversación, Mueble and Materiales tabs (the Studio's own, unchanged). An invalid variant (InvalidCanvas). Bench case results and «Abrir en el estudio». The cama, mesa and zapatera groups open. Structural findings with stamps.\n7. OPEN FINDINGS\nUI-65 (where the workshop lives, decided). Open: do «Seleccionar las piezas» and «Copiar» ship in the first slice?\n8. HISTORY\n→ LOG frame, below.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
